  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Plaistow, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About  \t\t\t \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I?   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t 2025 Online Motor Vehicle Registrations, Dog Licenses, Vital Records Links \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registrations \r\n\t\t\t Deliberative Session Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Information \r\n\t\t\t New Residents Information \r\n\t\t\t Proof of Voter Identity Instructions \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records - Certificates of Birth, Death, Divorce & Marriages \r\n\t\t\t Voter Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Elections & Absentee Ballot Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Voter Registration Information \r\nHome \nGovernment \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nOverview \nEFFECTIVE July 12, 2019 \nTo comply with the amended New Hampshire RSA 261:148 \nYou must present your \nPHOTO I.D. \nfor ALL \nMotor Vehicle transactions. \nEven if you are NOT the owner of the vehicle. \nATTENTION RESIDENTS: \nDue to the increased volume of citizens not bringing in their renewal paperwork or registrations,  we will only look up 2 vehicles per visit.  Be aware if the wrong vehicle is looked up and processed, you are responsible for sending to the State for a refund. The Town doesn’t refund until after the State approves your refund \r\nCalendar \r\nWed, Oct. 21   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Senior Halloween Party  \r\nMon, Oct. 26   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Supervisor of the Checklist Meeting Voter Info \r\nTue, Oct. 27   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Election Training \r\n\t\t         View All Events \r\n/Calendar.aspx \r\nNews Flash \r\n\t Election Day  \r\nElection Day - Tuesday, November 3, 2026\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t Voter Registration Info  \r\n\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t The Energy Committee is Seeking New and Alternate Members  \r\nIf you are interested in serving as a member to the Energy Committee, click here.\t \r\n\t\t View All News \r\n/CivicAlerts.aspx \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tMartha  Fowler, NHCTC\r\nTown Clerk \r\nPhone:  603-382-8129 \r\nMore Information \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 145 Main Street  \n\t\t\t\t\t Plaistow ,  NH   03865 \r\n145 Main Street   Plaistow NH 03865 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  603-382-8129 \r\nFax: 603-382-7183 \r\nHours: \nMonday 7 am - 5 pm. \nTuesday through Thursday \n8 am to 4 pm. \nFriday: CLOSED \nClosed weekends and holidays \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t\t\tLisa  Sverker \r\nDeputy Town Clerk \r\nMore Information \r\n\t\t\t\t\tJulie  McNamara, CTC\r\nAssistant Town Clerk \r\nMore Information \r\nFAQs \r\n             Looking for Voter Registration Info? \r\n             When is the next election? \r\n             Where do I vote? \r\n         View All FAQs \r\n/FAQ.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Trash & Recycling \r\n\t\t\t Property Viewer \r\n\t\t\t Employment Opportunities \r\n\t\t\t Pay My Bill \r\n\t\t\t Recreation \r\nTown of Plaistow, NH \r\nTown Hall \r\n145 Main Street \r\nPlaistow, NH 03865 \r\nPhone:  (603) 382-5200 \r\nFax: (603) 382-7183 \r\nTown Hall Hours: Monday 7am - 5pm | Tue - Thu 8am - 4pm | Closed Friday \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
